    <p class="labor-line">52 weeks a year,</p>
    <p class="labor-still">and still cannot make ends meet.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="labor-title" class="opening-question">So what is it?</h2>

  <ul class="answer-cloud" aria-label="Possible explanations">
    <li>Luck</li>
    <li>DNA</li>
    <li>IQ</li>
    <li>EQ</li>
    <li>class</li>
    <li>race</li>
    <li>skin color</li>
